#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>注意</ui-edge-color></ui-color> : 低解像度(480p/i 576p/i)モードで起動中。<br>本作は高解像度(720p)モード推奨です。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Achtung:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Du spielst mit niedriger Auflösung (480p/i 576p/i).<br>Wir empfehlen eine Auflösung von 720p.
#. fr: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Attention</ui-edge-color></ui-color><nbsp>: Vous êtes en mode basse résolution (480p/i ou 576p/i).<br>Le mode haute résolution (720p) est recommandé pour un confort de jeu optimal.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Lobby:13:0:3"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Warning!</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Screen resolution is set to Low (480p/i 576p/i)<br>The recommended setting is High (720p)."
msgstr "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Предупреждение!</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Выбрана низкая руна (480p/i 576p/i)<br>Рекомендуется высокая руна (720p)."

#. ja: OK
#. de: Ok
#. fr: OK
