#. ja: Gladiator
#. de: GLADIATOR
#. fr: Gladiateur
#. column 4:
#. column 5: Gladiators specialize in the handling of all manner of one-handed\nblades, from daggers to longswords, be they single- or double-edged,\nstraight or curved. A defining characteristic of the art is its emphasis\non diverse combat tactics, training its members to bring their martial\nskills to bear in any situation. As such, there are practitioners who\nmarry sword with shield, seeking to defend their fellow companions.\nOthers opt for an empty off hand, choosing instead to focus entirely\non their sword arm. In all instances, the ages-old art of the sword\nmakes the gladiator a formidable adversary in any encounter.\n\nCorresponding Job: Paladin
msgctxt "Lobby:178:0:3"
msgid "Gladiator"
msgstr "Гладиатор"

#. ja: 剣術士
#. column 3: Gladiator
#. column 5: Gladiators specialize in the handling of all manner of one-handed\nblades, from daggers to longswords, be they single- or double-edged,\nstraight or curved. A defining characteristic of the art is its emphasis\non diverse combat tactics, training its members to bring their martial\nskills to bear in any situation. As such, there are practitioners who\nmarry sword with shield, seeking to defend their fellow companions.\nOthers opt for an empty off hand, choosing instead to focus entirely\non their sword arm. In all instances, the ages-old art of the sword\nmakes the gladiator a formidable adversary in any encounter.\n\nCorresponding Job: Paladin
msgctxt "Lobby:178:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 剣術士（けんじゅつし）。\n諸刃の直剣から片刃の曲刀まで、幅広い種類の「片手剣」を主武器とするファイター。\n「魅せる戦い」が求められる剣闘士たちの技を源流とするため、盾で巧みに攻撃を防ぎ、\n流れるような剣さばきで敵を切り刻む防御主体の剣術が発達。 \n集団戦においては切り込み役として真っ先に攻めかかると同時に、\n敵を曳きつけ味方を守る文字通りの「盾」となる。\n\n剣術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： ナイト\nゲーム開始都市 ： ウルダハ
#. de: Gladiatoren sind Meister der Schwerter - egal, ob es sich dabei um\nein- oder zweischneidige Klingen, Krummsäbel oder Langschwerter\nhandelt. Im Kolosseum lernen Gladiatoren auf schmerzhafte Weise,\nsich unterschiedlichen Situationen anzupassen. Während sie geschickt\nHiebe gegen ihre Gegner führen, schützen sie mit Schilden sich\nselbst und ihre Kameraden. Bei Bedarf verzichten sie auf Schilde und\nkonzentrieren sich ganz auf den Angriff. In jedem Fall kämpfen sie\nimmer an vorderster Front, wo sie die Aufmerksamkeit der Feinde\nauf sich ziehen, um ihre Mitstreiter zu entlasten.\n\nJob, der auf Gladiator folgt: Paladin\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Ul'dah
#. fr: De la dague à l'épée en passant par le sabre, les gladiateurs \nmaîtrisent une grande variété d'armes blanches. Leur style,\ndéfensif et principalement inspiré de techniques utilisées\nlors de "combats-spectacles", consiste à dévier habilement\nde leur bouclier les attaques avant de pourfendre leurs\nadversaires d'un coup précis et puissant. Dans les batailles\nen groupe, leur rôle est de créer une brèche dans les lignes\nennemies tout en servant de rempart à leurs alliés.\n\nJob correspondant : paladin\nCité de départ : Ul'dah
#. column 3: Gladiator
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:178:0:5"
msgid "Gladiators specialize in the handling of all manner of one-handed\nblades, from daggers to longswords, be they single- or double-edged,\nstraight or curved. A defining characteristic of the art is its emphasis\non diverse combat tactics, training its members to bring their martial\nskills to bear in any situation. As such, there are practitioners who\nmarry sword with shield, seeking to defend their fellow companions.\nOthers opt for an empty off hand, choosing instead to focus entirely\non their sword arm. In all instances, the ages-old art of the sword\nmakes the gladiator a formidable adversary in any encounter.\n\nCorresponding Job: Paladin"
msgstr "Гладиаторы владеют самыми разными одноручными клинками: от кинжалов до длинных мечей, прямых и изогнутых, одно- и обоюдоострых. Их искусство строится на разнообразной тактике и учит сражаться в любой ситуации. Одни сочетают меч со щитом, чтобы защищать товарищей. Другие оставляют вторую руку свободной и полагаются лишь на клинок. В любом случае многовековое искусство владения мечом делает гладиатора грозным противником.\n\nПрофессия: паладин"

#. ja: Pugilist
#. de: FAUSTKÄMPFER
#. fr: Pugiliste
#. column 4:
#. column 5: The path of the pugilist is one of incessant training aimed at mastering\nthe traditional techniques of hand-to-hand combat. Though they\ncommand formidable power when unarmed, they are wont to use metal,\nleather, and bone weaponry to maximize their destructive potential.\n\nTheir preference for fighting at close quarters makes negotiating\ndistances an absolute necessity. This is why many pugilists are quick\nto learn that lightweight gear allowing for maximum agility ensures them\nbetter success in battle than does cumbersome plate or chain.\n\nCorresponding Job: Monk
msgctxt "Lobby:180:0:3"
msgid "Pugilist"
msgstr "Кулачный боец"

#. ja: 格闘士
#. column 3: Pugilist
#. column 5: The path of the pugilist is one of incessant training aimed at mastering\nthe traditional techniques of hand-to-hand combat. Though they\ncommand formidable power when unarmed, they are wont to use metal,\nleather, and bone weaponry to maximize their destructive potential.\n\nTheir preference for fighting at close quarters makes negotiating\ndistances an absolute necessity. This is why many pugilists are quick\nto learn that lightweight gear allowing for maximum agility ensures them\nbetter success in battle than does cumbersome plate or chain.\n\nCorresponding Job: Monk
msgctxt "Lobby:180:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 格闘士（かくとうし）。\n伝統的な護身術を修得したファイター。 \n鍛え抜かれた拳はすでに武器を帯びているに等しいが、手の延長上に\n「格闘武器」を装着することによって、その破壊力はさらに倍加される。\n肉体の動きを阻む甲冑を嫌い軽装を好む彼らは、一見すると無防備にも見えるが、\nその素早い身のこなしで打撃を重ね、確実に敵を追い込んでいく。\n\n格闘士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： モンク\nゲーム開始都市 ： ウルダハ
#. de: Faustkämpfer erdulden hartes körperliches Training, um die\ntraditionellen Selbstverteidigungstechniken zu erlernen.\nSie sind Meister des waffenlosen Kampfes und im Umgang\nmit Faustwaffen aus Metall, Leder oder Knochen.\nUm möglichst schnell an ihre Gegner heranzukommen,\nverzichten viele Faustkämpfer auf schwere Rüstungen\nzugunsten der Beweglichkeit.\n\nJob, der auf Faustkämpfer folgt: Mönch\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Ul'dah
#. fr: Ces combattants se servent de techniques d'attaque ancestrales. \nDéjà redoutables à mains nues grâce à leur entraînement\nrigoureux, ils voient leur puissance de destruction décuplée\nlorsqu'ils s'équipent d'armes de corps à corps. Leur préférence\npour les armures légères peut laisser à penser qu'ils sont\nsans défense, mais ils profitent de cette aisance de\nmouvement et de leur vitesse pour surprendre leurs\nadversaires et placer des contres assassins.\n\nJob correspondant : moine\nCité de départ : Ul'dah
#. column 3: Pugilist
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:180:0:5"
msgid "The path of the pugilist is one of incessant training aimed at mastering\nthe traditional techniques of hand-to-hand combat. Though they\ncommand formidable power when unarmed, they are wont to use metal,\nleather, and bone weaponry to maximize their destructive potential.\n\nTheir preference for fighting at close quarters makes negotiating\ndistances an absolute necessity. This is why many pugilists are quick\nto learn that lightweight gear allowing for maximum agility ensures them\nbetter success in battle than does cumbersome plate or chain.\n\nCorresponding Job: Monk"
msgstr "Путь кулачного бойца — это бесконечные тренировки и освоение традиционных приёмов рукопашного боя. Даже без оружия кулачный боец наносит сокрушительные удары, но металлические, кожаные и костяные накладки помогают ему раскрыть разрушительную силу в полную меру.\n\nКулачные бойцы предпочитают сражаться вблизи, поэтому им важно быстро сокращать дистанцию. Лёгкое снаряжение даёт больше свободы движений и ловкости, а значит, помогает в бою куда лучше, чем тяжёлый панцирь или кольчуга.\n\nПрофессия: монах"

#. ja: Marauder
#. de: MARODEUR
#. fr: Maraudeur
#. column 4:
#. column 5: The marauder is a combat specialist whose weapon of choice is\nthe greataxe－a fearsome arm emblematic of Eorzea's pirates.\nTheir approach to battle is one of brute force, relying on strength\nand steel to crush enemies and sunder weapons. They are highly\nsought after for their ferocity and intimidating presence, and are\noften employed to hunt down monsters plaguing the land, or to turn\nthe tide of battle between warring nations.\n\nCorresponding Job: Warrior
msgctxt "Lobby:182:0:3"
msgid "Marauder"
msgstr "Мародёр"

#. ja: 斧術士
#. column 3: Marauder
#. column 5: The marauder is a combat specialist whose weapon of choice is\nthe greataxe－a fearsome arm emblematic of Eorzea's pirates.\nTheir approach to battle is one of brute force, relying on strength\nand steel to crush enemies and sunder weapons. They are highly\nsought after for their ferocity and intimidating presence, and are\noften employed to hunt down monsters plaguing the land, or to turn\nthe tide of battle between warring nations.\n\nCorresponding Job: Warrior
msgctxt "Lobby:182:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 斧術士（ふじゅつし）。\n海賊が敵船破壊や強襲上陸で用いる「両手斧」を主武器とするファイター。 \n伝統的な海賊武器という印象が強いが、都市間の戦争や強大な魔物の討伐戦で\n大暴れし、英雄として武名を残した斧術士も少なくない。\n鍛え上げた肉体で、巨大な戦斧を力任せに振り回す豪快な戦闘スタイルは圧巻。\n敵陣の只中で、悠然と踏みとどまる度胸こそが最大の武器となるだろう。\n\n斧術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 戦士\nゲーム開始都市 ： リムサ・ロミンサ
#. de: Marodeure sind auf den Kampf mit zweihändig geführten Äxten\nspezialisiert. Ihre Strategie ist ebenso einfach wie wirkungsvoll:\nMit brutaler Gewalt und hartem Stahl zerschmettern sie ihre Feinde!\nMarodeure findet man besonders oft unter Piraten, doch auch als\nSöldner und Monsterjäger bringen sie ihre enorme Kampfkraft\nzur Geltung. Geübte Marodeure nehmen es leicht mit Horden von\nGegnern auf und erschlagen selbst die größten Monster.\n\nJob, der auf Marodeur folgt: Krieger\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Limsa Lominsa
#. fr: Les maraudeurs sont souvent assimilés à des brigands, car\nleur arme de prédilection, la grande hache, est aussi celle\ndes pirates. Il est vrai que leur façon d'assener furieusement\nles coups ne fait que renforcer cette image, mais leur\nprincipale force est certainement leur faculté à garder leur\nsang-froid même au cœur de la mêlée. Nombre d'entre eux se\nsont distingués au cours de l'Histoire, que ce soit lors de guerres \nentre cités ou pour avoir vaincu des créatures redoutables.\n\nJob correspondant : guerrier\nCité de départ : Limsa Lominsa
#. column 3: Marauder
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:182:0:5"
msgid "The marauder is a combat specialist whose weapon of choice is\nthe greataxe－a fearsome arm emblematic of Eorzea's pirates.\nTheir approach to battle is one of brute force, relying on strength\nand steel to crush enemies and sunder weapons. They are highly\nsought after for their ferocity and intimidating presence, and are\noften employed to hunt down monsters plaguing the land, or to turn\nthe tide of battle between warring nations.\n\nCorresponding Job: Warrior"
msgstr "Мародёры — искусные бойцы, предпочитающие огромный топор, грозное оружие пиратов Эорзеи. В бою они полагаются на грубую силу и сталь: сокрушают врагов и ломают оружие. Их ценят за свирепость и устрашающий вид, поэтому часто нанимают охотиться на чудовищ, терзающих окрестности, или переломить ход войны между враждующими государствами.\n\nПрофессия: воин"

#. ja: Lancer
#. de: PIKENIER
#. fr: Maître d'hast
#. column 4:
#. column 5: The strategy of the lancers is to outrange and fluster opponents\nwith their long, two-handed polearms, peppering them with a barrage\nof thrusting attacks. They are trained with a number of weapons,\ngiving a diversity to their attacks that makes them extremely\nversatile combatants.\n\nIn former times, the longspear saw the most widespread use,\ndue in great part to the influence of the proud lancer legions of\nAla Mhigo. Since then, the guild has greatly expanded its armories\nto include a variety of weaponry, such as the halberd and the trident.\n\nCorresponding Job: Dragoon
msgctxt "Lobby:184:0:3"
msgid "Lancer"
msgstr "Копейщик"

#. ja: 槍術士
#. column 3: Lancer
#. column 5: The strategy of the lancers is to outrange and fluster opponents\nwith their long, two-handed polearms, peppering them with a barrage\nof thrusting attacks. They are trained with a number of weapons,\ngiving a diversity to their attacks that makes them extremely\nversatile combatants.\n\nIn former times, the longspear saw the most widespread use,\ndue in great part to the influence of the proud lancer legions of\nAla Mhigo. Since then, the guild has greatly expanded its armories\nto include a variety of weaponry, such as the halberd and the trident.\n\nCorresponding Job: Dragoon
msgctxt "Lobby:184:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 槍術士（そうじゅつし）。\n狩猟用の槍や銛から発展した「両手槍」を主武器とするファイター。 \n強盛を誇ったアラミゴのパイク兵の影響で、かつては柄の長さを競う風潮があったが、\n現在は多様な形式の槍が混在している。\n長柄の得物を思いのままに操るのは、決して簡単ではない。しかし、ひとたび\nその技を学びとれば、吹き荒れる嵐の如く次々と戦技を繰り出すことができるだろう。\n\n槍術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 竜騎士\nゲーム開始都市 ： グリダニア
#. de: Pikeniere nutzen die überlegene Reichweite ihrer langen Stangenwaffen,\nmit denen sie einen Wirbelsturm aus Schlägen und Stößen entfachen.\nDazu gehören Jagdwaffen wie Speere und Harpunen, aber auch speziell\nfür die Schlacht gedachte Waffen wie Hellebarden oder der Langspieß\nder ruhmreichen mhigischen Gardisten.\nIhr breitgefächtertes Waffenarsenal und flexible Kampftechniken\nmachen Pikeniere zu äußerst flexiblen und gefährlichen Kämpfern.\n\nJob, der auf Pikenier folgt: Dragoon\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Gridania
#. fr: La lance est restée l'arme de prédilection des soldats de\nlongues années durant, notamment sous l'influence des\nredoutables troupes de piquiers d'Ala Mhigo. Depuis, les\nmaîtres d'hast ont etoffé leur arsenal et leurs techniques.\nSi le maniement de ces armes demande une habileté que\nconfère seul un long entraînement, les combattants\nles plus expérimentés sont capables d'asséner des\ncoups dévastateurs à une vitesse prodigieuse.\n\nJob correspondant : chevalier dragon\nCité de départ : Gridania
#. column 3: Lancer
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:184:0:5"
msgid "The strategy of the lancers is to outrange and fluster opponents\nwith their long, two-handed polearms, peppering them with a barrage\nof thrusting attacks. They are trained with a number of weapons,\ngiving a diversity to their attacks that makes them extremely\nversatile combatants.\n\nIn former times, the longspear saw the most widespread use,\ndue in great part to the influence of the proud lancer legions of\nAla Mhigo. Since then, the guild has greatly expanded its armories\nto include a variety of weaponry, such as the halberd and the trident.\n\nCorresponding Job: Dragoon"
msgstr "Копейщики держат противника на расстоянии длинным двуручным древковым оружием и осыпают его градом колющих ударов. Они обучаются владеть разными видами оружия, поэтому могут приспособиться к любой ситуации в бою.\n\nВ прежние времена чаще всего использовали длинные копья — во многом благодаря прославленным легионам копейщиков Ала Миго. С тех пор оружейный арсенал гильдии заметно расширился: в него вошли алебарды, трезубцы и многие другие виды оружия.\n\nПрофессия: драконит"

#. ja: Archer
#. de: WALDLÄUFER
#. fr: Archer
#. column 4:
#. column 5: The enduring popularity of the bow is a testament to its elegant\ndesign, but this simple weapon would be of little worth without the\nsurpassing skill of those who master it－the archers. Projectile\ntechniques such as high-angle fire enable archers to assail their\nfoes with deadly precision even at great distances.\n\nConstant assessment of the battlefield enables them to carefully\ndetermine the most advantageous ground from which to loose,\nas well as the nature of the arrows best suited to their enemy.\nTogether with the longbow sentries of the Elezen military, the\nshortbow hunters among the Miqo'te are widely regarded as\nmost skilled with the bow.\n\nCorresponding Job: Bard
msgctxt "Lobby:186:0:3"
msgid "Archer"
msgstr "Лучник"

#. ja: 弓術士
#. column 3: Archer
#. column 5: The enduring popularity of the bow is a testament to its elegant\ndesign, but this simple weapon would be of little worth without the\nsurpassing skill of those who master it－the archers. Projectile\ntechniques such as high-angle fire enable archers to assail their\nfoes with deadly precision even at great distances.\n\nConstant assessment of the battlefield enables them to carefully\ndetermine the most advantageous ground from which to loose,\nas well as the nature of the arrows best suited to their enemy.\nTogether with the longbow sentries of the Elezen military, the\nshortbow hunters among the Miqo'te are widely regarded as\nmost skilled with the bow.\n\nCorresponding Job: Bard
msgctxt "Lobby:186:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 弓術士（きゅうじゅつし）。\n遠距離からの狙撃や曲射を旨とする「弓」を主武器とするファイター。 \nエオルゼアでは、エレゼン族の弓兵が得意とした長弓術と\nミコッテ族の猟人伝統の短弓術とが普及している。\nそれぞれ異なる弓の特性を理解し、射掛けるのに有利なポジションを選ぶことが、\n良き弓術士に至る第一歩となるだろう。\n熟練の弓術士ともなれば、雨の如く矢を降らせる妙技を放つとも言われている。\n\n弓術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 吟遊詩人\nゲーム開始都市 ： グリダニア
#. de: Ob mit dem Langbogen der Elezen oder dem Kurzbogen miqo'tischer Jäger - \ndie Waldläufer sind Meister des Fernangriffs und verstehen sich darauf, \nFeinde aus der Distanz unter Beschuss zu nehmen. Sie kennen die \nSchwächen der Gegner und bereiten sich strategisch auf einen Kampf vor. \nFür jeden Einsatz wählen sie ihre Waffe sorgfältig aus und erkunden die \ngünstigste Position, um einen wahren Pfeilhagel auf ihre Gegner \nniederprasseln zu lassen.\n\nJob, der auf Waldläufer folgt: Barde\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Gridania
#. fr: Ces spécialistes du combat à distance sont capables d'adapter\nleurs techniques de tir en fonction des arcs qu'ils utilisent.\nLes plus communs en Éorzéa sont l'arc long des soldats élézens\net l'arc court des chasseurs miqo'tes. La compréhension\ndes spécificités des armes et la faculté de se positionner\ncorrectement sont deux qualités primordiales pour devenir\nun bon archer. Les pratiquants les plus expérimentés peuvent\nfaire pleuvoir des salves de flèches sur leurs ennemis.\n\nJob correspondant : barde\nCité de départ : Gridania
#. column 3: Archer
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:186:0:5"
msgid "The enduring popularity of the bow is a testament to its elegant\ndesign, but this simple weapon would be of little worth without the\nsurpassing skill of those who master it－the archers. Projectile\ntechniques such as high-angle fire enable archers to assail their\nfoes with deadly precision even at great distances.\n\nConstant assessment of the battlefield enables them to carefully\ndetermine the most advantageous ground from which to loose,\nas well as the nature of the arrows best suited to their enemy.\nTogether with the longbow sentries of the Elezen military, the\nshortbow hunters among the Miqo'te are widely regarded as\nmost skilled with the bow.\n\nCorresponding Job: Bard"
msgstr ""

#. ja: Conjurer
#. de: DRUIDE
#. fr: Élémentaliste
#. column 4:
#. column 5: Conjury calls upon elemental forces present in nature and concentrates\nthem to a potency at which spells can be woven. Through practiced\nmeditation on the essences of creation, conjurers draw forth and\nabsorb aether from their immediate surroundings. A wand or cane\nmade from unworked wood is then utilized to focus the aether until it\nmanifests as the desired spell. The seat of the Conjurers' Guild lies at\nStillglade Fane in Gridania, where the voices of Eorzea's elementals are\nsaid to be most powerful.\n\nCorresponding Job: White Mage
msgctxt "Lobby:188:0:3"
msgid "Conjurer"
msgstr "Заклинатель"

#. ja: 幻術士
#. column 3: Conjurer
#. column 5: Conjury calls upon elemental forces present in nature and concentrates\nthem to a potency at which spells can be woven. Through practiced\nmeditation on the essences of creation, conjurers draw forth and\nabsorb aether from their immediate surroundings. A wand or cane\nmade from unworked wood is then utilized to focus the aether until it\nmanifests as the desired spell. The seat of the Conjurers' Guild lies at\nStillglade Fane in Gridania, where the voices of Eorzea's elementals are\nsaid to be most powerful.\n\nCorresponding Job: White Mage
msgctxt "Lobby:188:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 幻術士（げんじゅつし）。\n幻術と呼ばれる、属性の影響が強い魔法を操るソーサラー。\n己の周囲に満ちる万物を観想し、土、風、水の属性元素を見出すことができる。 \n自然物から作り出された杖状の魔器「幻具」を携帯しており、\nそれを依代として己のエーテルと周囲の元素を魔法に変換する。\n回復や強化といった肉体に働きかける魔法にも長けるため、\n高位の幻術士は癒し手としても一流の腕を持つ。\n\n幻術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 白魔道士\nゲーム開始都市 ： グリダニア
#. de: Druiden nutzen eine animistische Form der Magie, um die elementaren \nUrkräfte der Natur zu manipulieren und daraus Zauber zu weben. \nSie kommunizieren mit den Geistern und kanalisieren mit ihren Stäben \nden Äther, der alles umgibt, um ihn in die gewünschten Zauber zu \ntransformieren. Druiden verstehen es meisterhaft, ermattete Körper \nzu stärken und die Regeneration zu beschleunigen.\n\nJob, der auf Druide folgt: Weißmagier\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Gridania
#. fr: Grâce à leur parfaite connaissance de la nature, les\nélémentalistes sont capables de tirer l'éther présent\ndans leur environnement et de le convertir en une\npuissante énergie qu'ils utilisent pour alimenter\nleur magie. Les pratiquants de cette discipline étant\nparticulièrement versés dans les sorts de guérison\net de renfort, ils sont généralement très sollicités\npar les groupes d'aventuriers qui partent en mission.\n\nJob correspondant : mage blanc\nCité de départ : Gridania
#. column 3: Conjurer
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:188:0:5"
msgid "Conjury calls upon elemental forces present in nature and concentrates\nthem to a potency at which spells can be woven. Through practiced\nmeditation on the essences of creation, conjurers draw forth and\nabsorb aether from their immediate surroundings. A wand or cane\nmade from unworked wood is then utilized to focus the aether until it\nmanifests as the desired spell. The seat of the Conjurers' Guild lies at\nStillglade Fane in Gridania, where the voices of Eorzea's elementals are\nsaid to be most powerful.\n\nCorresponding Job: White Mage"
msgstr "Заклинатели черпают силу в природных стихиях и сосредоточивают её, чтобы творить магию. В медитации они постигают суть мироздания, а затем вбирают эфир из окружающего мира. С помощью посоха из необработанного дерева заклинатель направляет эфир, пока тот не воплотится в нужное заклинание. Гильдия заклинателей находится в Святилище Тихой рощи в Гридании: считается, что именно там голоса элементалей Эорзеи звучат громче всего.\n\nПрофессия: белый маг"

#. ja: Thaumaturge
#. de: THAUMATURG
#. fr: Occultiste
#. column 4:
#. column 5: In the hands of a skilled practitioner, thaumaturgy can be a force of\nterrifying destruction. At the heart of this school of magic lies the\nability to call forth and command the latent aether within oneself\nthrough deep introspection. To then mold that aether into sorcery,\nthe thaumaturge makes use of a scepter or staff, within which is\nhoused a medium－a natural stone imbued with magical properties.\n\nCorresponding Job: Black Mage
msgctxt "Lobby:190:0:3"
msgid "Thaumaturge"
msgstr "Тауматург"

#. ja: 呪術士
#. column 3: Thaumaturge
#. column 5: In the hands of a skilled practitioner, thaumaturgy can be a force of\nterrifying destruction. At the heart of this school of magic lies the\nability to call forth and command the latent aether within oneself\nthrough deep introspection. To then mold that aether into sorcery,\nthe thaumaturge makes use of a scepter or staff, within which is\nhoused a medium－a natural stone imbued with magical properties.\n\nCorresponding Job: Black Mage
msgctxt "Lobby:190:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 呪術士（じゅじゅつし）。\n呪術と呼ばれる、破壊的性格の強い魔法を操るソーサラー。\n己の本性を内観することで、心の内に秘める力を操ることができる。\n念珠を嵌め込んだ笏状の魔器「呪具」を携帯しており、それを注力点として\n己のエーテルを魔法に変換する。\n彼らが操る呪いと破壊の魔法は、時に剣よりも鋭く敵を傷つけ、\n致命傷を与えるだろう。\n\n呪術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 黒魔道士\nゲーム開始都市 ： ウルダハ
#. de: Die arkane Kunst der Thaumaturgie entfaltet eine verheerende Macht\nund bringt Unheil und Verderben über ihre Opfer.\nDie dafür nötige Kraft ziehen Thaumaturgen aus sich selbst, indem sie\nmit Stäben den Äther, der ihre Körper durchströmt, kanalisieren.\nThaumaturgen sind Meister der arkanen Magie, mit der sie\ngrässlichere Wunden schlagen als das schärfste Schwert.\n\nJob, der auf Thaumaturg folgt: Schwarzmagier\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Ul'dah
#. fr: Par une étude poussée de leur moi profond, les occultistes\ndeviennent capables de ressentir l'éther présent dans leur\ncorps et de le contrôler à leur guise. Afin d'extraire et\nconvertir cette énergie, ils utilisent des armes spécialement\nconçues dans ce but. Il s'agit généralement de sceptres et\nde bâtons sertis d'une pierre naturelle imprégnée de\npouvoirs magiques. Les sorts qu'ils lancent sont si puissants\nqu'ils peuvent facilement renverser l'issue d'un combat.\n\nJob correspondant : mage noir\nCité de départ : Ul'dah
#. column 3: Thaumaturge
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:190:0:5"
msgid "In the hands of a skilled practitioner, thaumaturgy can be a force of\nterrifying destruction. At the heart of this school of magic lies the\nability to call forth and command the latent aether within oneself\nthrough deep introspection. To then mold that aether into sorcery,\nthe thaumaturge makes use of a scepter or staff, within which is\nhoused a medium－a natural stone imbued with magical properties.\n\nCorresponding Job: Black Mage"
msgstr "В руках опытного мага тауматургия становится орудием ужасающего разрушения. В основе этого искусства — умение заглянуть в себя, пробудить скрытый эфир и подчинить его своей воле. Чтобы направить эфир в магию, тауматург использует скипетр или посох с природным камнем, наделённым магическими свойствами.\n\nПрофессия: чёрный маг"

#. ja: Arcanist
#. de: HERMETIKER
#. fr: Arcaniste
#. column 4:
#. column 5: Adepts of the art of arcanum derive their might from symbols of power\nborn of geometric techniques hailing from across the southern seas.\nHeld within occult grimoires, these symbols lend shape to the arcanist's\naether, thereby allowing him to produce myriad powerful spells. Using\nthe selfsame symbols to unlock the latent power contained within\ngemstones, arcanists are also able to summon forth the familiar known\nas Carbuncle to carry out their bidding.\n\nCorresponding Jobs: Summoner, Scholar
msgctxt "Lobby:192:0:3"
msgid "Arcanist"
msgstr "Арканист"

#. ja: 巴術士
#. column 3: Arcanist
#. column 5: Adepts of the art of arcanum derive their might from symbols of power\nborn of geometric techniques hailing from across the southern seas.\nHeld within occult grimoires, these symbols lend shape to the arcanist's\naether, thereby allowing him to produce myriad powerful spells. Using\nthe selfsame symbols to unlock the latent power contained within\ngemstones, arcanists are also able to summon forth the familiar known\nas Carbuncle to carry out their bidding.\n\nCorresponding Jobs: Summoner, Scholar
msgctxt "Lobby:192:0:4"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

#. ja: 巴術士（はじゅつし）。\n巴術と呼ばれる秘術を用い、使い魔を操るソーサラー。\n南洋渡来の算術を源流とし、独特の幾何学模様「魔紋」で精神力を制御する。\n数々の魔紋が描かれた魔器「魔道書」を携行しており、\nこれに己のエーテルを奔らせ魔法に変換する。\nまた、宝珠の神秘を解き明かした魔紋を用いることで、\n使い魔「カーバンクル」を生み出し、使役するという。\n\n巴術士を初期クラスとするジョブ ： 召喚士・学者(ヒーラー)\nゲーム開始都市 ： リムサ・ロミンサ
#. de: Aus den südlichen Gefilden stammt die mathematische Weltanschauung, \nmit der die Hermetiker die Natur beschreiben und die ihr innewohnenden \nmagischen Kräfte manipulieren. Mithilfe rätselhafter Äthergramme, \nkomplexe geometrische Muster, welche Hermetiker in ihren Grimoires \naufzeichnen, können sie mächtige Zaubersprüche sprechen und \nsogenannte Karfunkel herbeirufen. Diese magischen Wesen sind den \nHermetikern treue Gefährten auf ihrem abenteuerlichen Weg \ndurch Eorzea.\n\nJobs, die auf Hermetiker folgen: Beschwörer und Gelehrter\nStadtstaat, in dem das Spiel beginnt: Limsa Lominsa
#. fr: Les adeptes de cette discipline utilisent une forme de magie\ndérivée de l'arithmétique, une science qui est apparue et\ns'est développée dans les îles méridionales. Ils tirent leur\npouvoir de pentacles qu'ils consignent consciencieusement\ndans leurs grimoires. Ces diagrammes mystiques canalisent\nl'éther de leurs corps, leur permettant ainsi de lancer une\nmultitude de sorts. Ils sont également capables d'invoquer\npour les servir un familier appelé Carbuncle.\n\nJobs correspondants : invocateur, érudit (soigneur)\nCité de départ : Limsa Lominsa
#. column 3: Arcanist
#. column 4:
msgctxt "Lobby:192:0:5"
msgid "Adepts of the art of arcanum derive their might from symbols of power\nborn of geometric techniques hailing from across the southern seas.\nHeld within occult grimoires, these symbols lend shape to the arcanist's\naether, thereby allowing him to produce myriad powerful spells. Using\nthe selfsame symbols to unlock the latent power contained within\ngemstones, arcanists are also able to summon forth the familiar known\nas Carbuncle to carry out their bidding.\n\nCorresponding Jobs: Summoner, Scholar"
msgstr "Мастера тайного искусства черпают силу в могущественных символах, основанных на геометрических приёмах из южных морей. Арканисты записывают эти символы в зачарованные гримуары, с помощью которых придают форму эфиру и творят множество могущественных заклинаний. Те же знаки позволяют пробудить силу, заключённую в самоцветах, и призвать карбункула — фамильяра, который исполнит их волю.\n\nПрофессии: призыватель, учёный"

