#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)><br><br><icon 99><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>EXP bonuses are currently being granted to all new players<br>created on this world.</ui-edge-c… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
